{
  "readme": [
    "What has been looked at in the Kenney packs, and what each region is.",
    "",
    "This is metadata, not art: it names regions of packs that live in the private",
    "asset depot (jidousha-assets) and on the owner's machine, and never enter this",
    "repository. Committing it is what makes looking at a pack a one-time cost -- the",
    "next curation session reads this instead of re-rendering and re-reading contact",
    "sheets.",
    "",
    "Classification is ON DEMAND. Only regions relevant to an asset slot the game",
    "names are classified; everything else is listed under 'unclassified' with its",
    "extent, so a later session knows what was skipped rather than guessing it was",
    "empty. Labelling a whole pack would be hours spent on tags nobody will query.",
    "",
    "It arrived with giri and now serves ninjo's twenty-eight slots (UI.md section 7).",
    "",
    "Regenerate contact sheets with art/contact_sheet.py; sheets are never",
    "committed -- a whole pack rearranged into sheets is still the whole pack.",
    "",
    "Every pack is CC0 1.0 (each pack's own License.txt, quoted in assets/CREDITS.md).",
    "Kenney *requests* that whole packs not be redistributed; that is not a licence",
    "term, and the curation model honours it by construction."
  ],
